# {{.Name}}

This project uses Modary's database-free API Profile. Its selected components
and routes are visible in `internal/app/application.go`.

Run the application:

```sh
go run -mod=mod ./cmd/{{.ID}}
```

The server listens on `127.0.0.1:8080` by default. Set `MODARY_HTTP_ADDR` to
select another address.

Check the two initial endpoints:

```sh
curl http://127.0.0.1:8080/livez
curl http://127.0.0.1:8080/readyz
curl http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/ping
```

Run its tests:

```sh
go mod tidy
go test ./...
```
